  "translation": "Gomme Rekhabeame, morwa Selomo, a buša go Yehuda; Rekhabeame a be a le mengwaga ye masome a mane le tee ge a thoma go buša, gomme a buša mengwaga ye šupa le lesome go Yerushalayime, motse wo Yahwe a o kgethile go bea ⟨את⟩ leina la gagwe gona, go dihlopha tšohle tša Yisraele; gomme leina la mma gagwe ⟨ke⟩ Naama, mMmoani.",
